{"version":1,"content":"<p>據韓國媒體報道，三星電子（Samsung Electronics）將停止在香港銷售雪櫃、洗衣機、冷氣機及吸塵器等主要家電，為該公司繼5月宣布結束在內地銷售家電後的行動。</p><p>三星香港的客服職員稱未有收到相關資訊。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T08:38:22.355628+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":104,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T08:21:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T04:38:11.765095+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T08:38:22.355628+00:00","content_hash":"cadba78de0e1260ef926cf69abfed7c5c4cf12e5c5f02bd84e4247fc20d802e1","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}